THz Attenuator App
Copyright 2026 Dima Muhannad

This product includes software developed for control and calibration of
terahertz wire-grid polarizer attenuators (ATT-11-16-CA85 family).

The physical model is based on:
  E. Blanco et al., "Transmission of a wire-grid polarizer" (1986),
  in the Jones-matrix formalism, extended with a Drude conductivity term
  and a power-law scattering term.

